# The upstream root .gitignore excludes any directory named `examples/`, which silently
# swallowed `nova/examples/` — the tenant bundle every platform test loads. A suite that
# cannot run on a fresh clone is a suite whose passing means nothing.
#
# Re-included here rather than in the root file so the core patch budget stays at 1:
# `nova/**` does not exist upstream and cannot conflict.
!examples/
